                <pb facs="0499" n="455" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54v05p1/pg455"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>On December 13 Secretary Dulles held a meeting with Chancellor Adenauer to
                    discuss problems of mutual concern. After congratulating him on his victory in
                    the September elections, Dulles proceeded to raise the question of French
                    ratification of the European Defense Community Treaty. For a report on this
                    meeting, see telegram 2282 from Paris, December 14, <ref target="#pg865">page
                        865</ref>. A nine-page memorandum of their conversation, prepared by
                    MacArthur, Is in the CFM files, lot M 88, box 166.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
